<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>AI Encyclopedia 2026: 90+ Terms, Tools & Guides</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="AI Encyclopedia 2026: 90+ key terms, tools and concepts in AI, ML, and Generative AI with mixed EN/RU explanations." />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #05060a;
      --bg-elevated: #0b0e16;
      --card: #101421;
      --accent: #4f46e5;
      --accent-soft: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.18);
      --accent-strong: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.55);
      --text: #f9fafb;
      --text-muted: #9ca3af;
      --border-subtle: rgba(156, 163, 175, 0.25);
      --radius-lg: 18px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --radius-pill: 999px;
      --shadow-soft: 0 18px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      --shadow-glow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.25), 0 0 40px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.45);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", "Inter", sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #111827 0, #020617 40%, #000 90%);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 24px 16px 48px;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header.hero {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95), rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.98));
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: 28px 28px 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -40%;
      opacity: 0.5;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.2) 0, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.18) 0, transparent 50%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.2fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .badge-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .badge-main {
      padding: 4px 11px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.7);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .badge-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #f9fafb, #22c55e);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.9);
    }

    .badge-sub {
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .badge-sub span {
      font-size: 10px;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 32px);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .hero-title span.highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #a5b4fc, #22c55e);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 520px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hero-meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .hero-meta-item {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 4px 9px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(75, 85, 99, 0.8);
    }

    .hero-meta-item strong {
      color: #e5e7eb;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .hero-meta-dot {
      width: 3px;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.7);
    }

    .hero-actions {
      margin-top: 14px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #6366f1, #4f46e5);
      color: #f9fafb;
      border: none;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.7);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .btn-primary span {
      font-size: 11px;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .btn-primary::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), transparent);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover::after {
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    .btn-ghost {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.7);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 7px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .hero-right {
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95));
      border: 1px solid rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.6);
      padding: 14px 14px 12px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
    }

    .hero-right-inner {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
    }

    .hero-right-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .hero-right-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .hero-right-tag {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
      border: 1px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.6);
      color: #bfdbfe;
    }

    .hero-stat-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hero-stat-card {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.5), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98));
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(75, 85, 99, 0.9);
      padding: 8px 9px 7px;
    }

    .hero-stat-label {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .hero-stat-value {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .hero-stat-sub {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #6ee7b7;
    }

    .hero-list {
      margin-top: 4px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      padding: 7px 8px 7px;
      max-height: 152px;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .hero-list-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 3px 0;
    }

    .hero-list-term {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .hero-list-dot {
      width: 4px;
      height: 4px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.8);
    }

    .hero-list-pill {
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(75, 85, 99, 0.8);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98);
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .hero-glow-orbit {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      mix-blend-mode: screen;
      opacity: 0.16;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 120%, rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.85), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% -40%, rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.7), transparent 60%);
    }

    main {
      margin-top: 28px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.2fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.95);
      padding: 16px 16px 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }

    .panel-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .panel-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    .panel-subtitle {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .search-box {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .search-input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 8px 30px 8px 28px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
      border: 1px solid rgba(75, 85, 99, 0.9);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98));
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 13px;
      outline: none;
    }

    .search-input::placeholder {
      color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.8);
    }

    .search-icon {
      position: absolute;
      left: 11px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .search-kbd {
      position: absolute;
      right: 8px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
    }

    .filter-chips {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .chip {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 4px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98);
    }

    .chip.active {
      border-color: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.9);
      background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.18);
      color: #e5e7eb;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.4);
    }

    .stats-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .stats-pill {
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .stats-pill strong {
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    .term-list {
      margin-top: 6px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.99));
      max-height: 520px;
      overflow: auto;
      padding: 8px 10px 10px;
      scrollbar-width: thin;
      scrollbar-color: rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9) transparent;
    }

    .term-list::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 7px;
    }

    .term-list::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: transparent;
    }

    .term-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .term-item {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 8px 8px 7px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3.5fr) minmax(0, 1.8fr);
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
    }

    .term-item:nth-child(2n) {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.99), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96));
    }

    .term-item.highlighted {
      border-color: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.9);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.3);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.18), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98));
    }

    .term-header {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .term-name {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .term-tag {
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      color: #a5b4fc;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98);
    }

    .term-meta {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .term-desc {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    .term-right {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
      align-items: flex-end;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .term-label {
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98);
    }

    .term-tagline {
      font-size: 10px;
      max-width: 190px;
    }

    .term-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 4px;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .term-link-pill {
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .sidebar-section {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .sidebar-section:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .sidebar-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .sidebar-subtitle {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .quick-list {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.95);
      padding: 8px 9px;
    }

    .quick-item {
      padding: 4px 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .quick-item span:first-child {
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    .pill-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .pill {
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 3px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.95);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98);
    }

    .pill.hot {
      border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.9);
      color: #fecaca;
      background: rgba(127, 29, 29, 0.4);
    }

    .pill.cool {
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.9);
      color: #bfdbfe;
      background: rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.4);
    }

    .pill.neutral {
      border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.9);
      color: #bbf7d0;
      background: rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.4);
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-align: right;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      header.hero {
        padding: 18px 16px 14px;
      }

      .hero-inner {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .hero-right {
        order: -1;
      }

      main {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        padding: 16px 10px 32px;
      }

      header.hero {
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      .panel {
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 14px 12px 12px;
      }

      .term-item {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .term-right {
        align-items: flex-start;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-glow-orbit"></div>
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div>
          <div class="badge-row">
            <div class="badge-main">
              <span class="badge-dot"></span>
              <span>AI Encyclopedia · 2026 Edition</span>
            </div>
            <div class="badge-sub">
              <span>Public · Open reference</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title">
            AI Encyclopedia 2026: <span class="highlight">90+ Terms, Tools & Guides</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">
            Mixed EN/RU glossary for founders, makers и тех, кто хочет быстро ориентироваться в мире AI, ML и agentic systems.
            Термины — на английском, объяснения — понятным русским.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-meta">
            <div class="hero-meta-item">
              <span class="hero-meta-dot"></span>
              <span>Updated: <strong>2026</strong></span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-meta-item">
              <span class="hero-meta-dot"></span>
              <span><strong>90+</strong> entries · A–Z</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-meta-item">
              <span class="hero-meta-dot"></span>
              <span>Focus: <strong>GenAI · Agents · Safety</strong></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <button class="btn-primary" type="button" onclick="scrollToGlossary()">
              Browse glossary
              <span>Поиск + фильтры по категориям</span>
            </button>
            <button class="btn-ghost" type="button" onclick="scrollToGlossary()">
              A–Z Terms overview
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-right">
          <div class="hero-right-inner">
            <div class="hero-right-header">
              <div class="hero-right-title">AI Landscape · Snapshot</div>
              <div class="hero-right-tag">2026</div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-stat-grid">
              <div class="hero-stat-card">
                <div class="hero-stat-label">Core Concepts & ML</div>
                <div class="hero-stat-value">30+</div>
                <div class="hero-stat-sub">Basics, theory, metrics</div>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-stat-card">
                <div class="hero-stat-label">GenAI & Agents</div>
                <div class="hero-stat-value">40+</div>
                <div class="hero-stat-sub">LLMs, RAG, tools</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-list">
              <div class="hero-list-row">
                <div class="hero-list-term">
                  <span class="hero-list-dot"></span>
                  <span>Agentic AI · RAG · World Models</span>
                </div>
                <span class="hero-list-pill">Trends · 2026</span>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-list-row">
                <div class="hero-list-term">
                  <span class="hero-list-dot"></span>
                  <span>Prompt Engineering → Prompt Design</span>
                </div>
                <span class="hero-list-pill">From tricks to discipline</span>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-list-row">
                <div class="hero-list-term">
                  <span class="hero-list-dot"></span>
                  <span>Safety, Alignment, Governance</span>
                </div>
                <span class="hero-list-pill">Not только для корпораций</span>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-list-row">
                <div class="hero-list-term">
                  <span class="hero-list-dot"></span>
                  <span>MCP · Tools API · Function Calling</span>
                </div>
                <span class="hero-list-pill">Connect AI to real world</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="glossary">
      <section class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <div>
            <div class="panel-title">AI Glossary · A–Z</div>
            <div class="panel-subtitle">Search, filter by category и читай краткие русские объяснения ключевых AI‑терминов.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="search-box">
          <span class="search-icon">🔍</span>
          <input
            type="search"
            class="search-input"
            id="searchInput"
            placeholder="Поиск по названию, категории или описанию (например, &quot;RAG&quot; или &quot;embedding&quot;)..."
          />
          <div class="search-kbd">Ctrl/⌘ + F</div>
        </div>

